# Review ownership (plan: "Governance"). GitHub resolves the LAST matching rule, so specific paths
# come after the default. Each rule names the Entra group alias it stands for; while the repo has a
# single maintainer every rule maps to @shaheenks. When GitHub teams exist, replace the handle with
# the team that mirrors the alias (e.g. @org/payments-leads), per rule.
# tests/policy/test_codeowners.py fails if a team or source file, or a security-critical path, has
# no rule of its own.

# default (platform-admins)
*                                   @shaheenks

